": " When evening came, he was there alone.", "tokens": [51021, 1133, 5634, 1361, 11, 415, 390, 456, 3312, 13, 51143], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21752697552821432, "compression_ratio": 1.815884476534296, "no_speech_prob": 0.0070966086350381374}, {"id": 39, "seek": 14704, "start": 163.01999999999998, "end": 169.5, "text": " But the boat by this time was a long way from the land, beaten by the waves, for the wind was against them.", "tokens": [51164, 583, 264, 6582, 538, 341, 565, 390, 257, 938, 636, 490, 264, 2117, 11, 17909, 538, 264, 9417, 11, 337, 264, 2468, 390, 1970, 552, 13, 51488], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21752697552821432, "compression_ratio": 1.815884476534296, "no_speech_prob": 0.0070966086350381374}, {"id": 40, "seek": 14704, "start": 170.16, "end": 175.04, "text": " And in the fourth watch of the night, he came to them walking on the sea.", "tokens": [51521, 400, 294, 264, 6409, 1159, 295, 264, 1818, 11, 415, 1361, 281, 552, 4494, 322, 264, 4158, 13, 51765], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21752697552821432, "compression_ratio": 1.815884476534296, "no_speech_prob": 0.0070966086350381374}, {"id": 41, "seek": 14704, "start": 175.68, "end": 177.01999999999998, "text": " But when the disciples saw him, he said,", "tokens": [51797, 583, 562, 264, 17209, 1866, 796, 11, 415, 848, 11, 51864], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21752697552821432, "compression_ratio": 1.815884476534296, "no_speech_prob": 0.0070966086350381374}, {"id": 42, "seek": 17702, "start": 177.02, "end": 179.9, "text": " When they saw him walking on the sea, they were terrified and said,", "tokens": [50365, 1133, 436, 1866, 796, 4494, 322, 264, 4158, 11, 436, 645, 23051, 293, 848, 11, 50509], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19136695861816405, "compression_ratio": 1.599078341013825, "no_speech_prob": 0.009762531146407127}, {"id": 43, "seek": 17702, "start": 180.66, "end": 182.02, "text": " It is a ghost.", "tokens": [50547, 467, 307, 257, 8359, 13, 50615], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19136695861816405, "compression_ratio": 1.599078341013825, "no_speech_prob": 0.009762531146407127}, {"id": 44, "seek": 17702, "start": 182.68, "end": 186.4, "text": " And they cried out in fear, but immediately Jesus spoke to them, saying,", "tokens": [50648, 400, 436, 16266, 484, 294, 4240, 11, 457, 4258, 2705, 7179, 281, 552, 11, 1566, 11, 50834], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19136695861816405, "compression_ratio": 1.599078341013825, "no_speech_prob": 0.009762531146407127}, {"id": 45, "seek": 17702, "start": 187.20000000000002, "end": 191.3, "text": " Take heart, it is I. Do not be afraid.", "tokens": [50874, 3664, 1917, 11, 309, 307, 286, 13, 1144, 406, 312, 4638, 13, 51079], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19136695861816405, "compression_ratio": 1.599078341013825, "no_speech_prob": 0.009762531146407127}, {"id": 46, "seek": 17702, "start": 192.16000000000003, "end": 193.36, "text": " And Peter answered him,", "tokens": [51122, 400, 6508, 10103, 796, 11, 51182], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19136695861816405, "compression_ratio": 1.599078341013825, "no_speech_prob": 0.009762531146407127}, {"id": 47, "seek": 17702, "start": 194.06, "end": 199.74, "text": " Lord, if it is you, command me to come to you on the water.", "tokens": [51217, 3257, 11, 498, 309, 307, 291, 11, 5622, 385, 281, 808, 281, 291, 322, 264, 1281, 13, 51501], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19136695861816405, "compression_ratio": 1.599078341013825, "no_speech_prob": 0.009762531146407127}, {"id": 48, "seek": 17702, "start": 200.52, "end": 202.44, "text": " He said, Come.", "tokens": [51540, 634, 848, 11, 2492, 13, 51636], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19136695861816405, "compression_ratio": 1.599078341013825, "no_speech_prob": 0.009762531146407127}, {"id": 49, "seek": 17702, "start": 203.06, "end": 206.76000000000002, "text": " So Peter got out of the boat and walked on the water.", "tokens": [51667, 407, 6508, 658, 484, 295, 264, 6582, 293, 7628, 322, 264, 1281, 13, 51852], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.19136695861816405, "compression_ratio": 1.599078341013825, "no_speech_prob": 0.009762531146407127}, {"id": 50, "seek": 20702, "start": 207.02, "end": 208.06, "text": " And came to Jesus.", "tokens": [50365, 400, 1361, 281, 2705, 13, 50417], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20626631804874965, "compression_ratio": 1.6329113924050633, "no_speech_prob": 0.02420405112206936}, {"id": 51, "seek": 20702, "start": 208.60000000000002, "end": 213.04000000000002, "text": " But when he saw the wind, he was afraid, and beginning to sink, he cried out,", "tokens": [50444, 583, 562, 415, 1866, 264, 2468, 11, 415, 390, 4638, 11, 293, 2863, 281, 9500, 11, 415, 16266, 484, 11, 50666], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20626631804874965, "compression_ratio": 1.6329113924050633, "no_speech_prob": 0.02420405112206936}, {"id": 52, "seek": 20702, "start": 213.8, "end": 216.3, "text": " Lord, save me.", "tokens": [50704, 3257, 11, 3155, 385, 13, 50829], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20626631804874965, "compression_ratio": 1.6329113924050633, "no_speech_prob": 0.02420405112206936}, {"id": 53, "seek": 20702, "start": 217.24, "end": 221.22, "text": " Jesus immediately reached out his hand and took hold of him, saying to him,", "tokens": [50876, 2705, 4258, 6488, 484, 702, 1011, 293, 1890, 1797, 295, 796, 11, 1566, 281, 796, 11, 51075], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20626631804874965, "compression_ratio": 1.6329113924050633, "no_speech_prob": 0.02420405112206936}, {"id": 54, "seek": 20702, "start": 221.92000000000002, "end": 224.68, "text": " O you of little faith, why did you doubt?", "tokens": [51110, 422, 291, 295, 707, 4522, 11, 983, 630, 291, 6385, 30, 51248], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20626631804874965, "compression_ratio": 1.6329113924050633, "no_speech_prob": 0.02420405112206936}, {"id": 55, "seek": 20702, "start": 225.5, "end": 231.92000000000002, "text": " And when they got into the boat, the wind ceased, and those in the boat worshipped him, saying,", "tokens": [51289, 400, 562, 436, 658, 666, 264, 6582, 11, 264, 2468, 49917, 11, 293, 729, 294, 264, 6582, 35366, 5529, 796, 11, 1566, 11, 51610], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20626631804874965, "compression_ratio": 1.6329113924050633, "no_speech_prob": 0.02420405112206936}, {"id": 56, "seek": 20702, "start": 232.44, "end": 235.08, "text": " Truly you are the Son of God.", "tokens": [51636, 43548, 291, 366, 264, 5185, 295, 1265, 13, 51768], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20626631804874965, "compression_ratio": 1.6329113924050633, "no_speech_prob": 0.02420405112206936}, {"id": 57, "seek": 20702, "start": 235.46, "end": 237.0, "text": " And when they had crossed over,", "tokens": [51787, 400, 562, 436, 632, 14622, 670, 11, 51864], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.20626631804874965, "compression_ratio": 1.6329113924050633, "no_speech_prob": 0.02420405112206936}, {"id": 58, "seek": 23702, "start": 237.02, "end": 238.60000000000002, "text": " they came to land at Gennesaret.", "tokens": [50365, 436, 1361, 281, 2117, 412, 460, 42886, 11298, 13, 50444], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14608497350988253, "compression_ratio": 1.5739644970414202, "no_speech_prob": 0.006228724494576454}, {"id": 59, "seek": 23702, "start": 239.08, "end": 241.22, "text": " And when the men of that place recognized him,", "tokens": [50468, 400, 562, 264, 1706, 295, 300, 1081, 9823, 796, 11, 50575], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14608497350988253, "compression_ratio": 1.5739644970414202, "no_speech_prob": 0.006228724494576454}, {"id": 60, "seek": 23702, "start": 241.48000000000002, "end": 245.68, "text": " they sent around to all that region and brought to him all who were sick,", "tokens": [50588, 436, 2279, 926, 281, 439, 300, 4458, 293, 3038, 281, 796, 439, 567, 645, 4998, 11, 50798], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14608497350988253, "compression_ratio": 1.5739644970414202, "no_speech_prob": 0.006228724494576454}, {"id": 61, "seek": 23702, "start": 246.04000000000002, "end": 249.42000000000002, "text": " and implored him that they might only touch the fringe of his garment.", "tokens": [50816, 293, 8484, 2769, 796, 300, 436, 1062, 787, 2557, 264, 38764, 295, 702, 35084, 13, 50985], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14608497350988253, "compression_ratio": 1.5739644970414202, "no_speech_prob": 0.006228724494576454}, {"id": 62, "seek": 23702, "start": 250.0, "end": 252.24, "text": " And as many as touched it were made well.", "tokens": [51014, 400, 382, 867, 382, 9828, 309, 645, 1027, 731, 13, 51126], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.14608497350988253, "compression_ratio": 1.5739644970414202, "no_speech_prob": 0.006228724494576454}], "language": "English"}